<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21167] sanity test_413d: 400 subdirs on MDT0</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21167</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity test_413d fails with "400 subdirs on MDT0": all 400 subdirs created under a directory with qos_threshold_rr=100 land on MDT0 instead of being spread over the 4 MDTs (expected 100 each).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen on lustre-reviews review-ldiskfs-dne-arm (aarch64 client, 4 MDTs, ldiskfs):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="alternate" type="square"&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;change 69798 ps5, 2026-11-09, &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/f372382a-f650-4d7c-ad66-5a4ae44507a9" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/f372382a-f650-4d7c-ad66-5a4ae44507a9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;change 68160 ps47, 2026-11-07, &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/482b5777-5952-4d4b-8392-76fb08e9931c" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/482b5777-5952-4d4b-8392-76fb08e9931c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;change 70348 ps1, 2026-11-04, review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-1 ("0 subdirs on MDT0"), &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/f87e1712-9c60-45aa-b64b-2316d3b5b567" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/f87e1712-9c60-45aa-b64b-2316d3b5b567&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;About 20 failures since 2025-01-20, none ticketed, on unrelated changes from different uploaders; 69798 only touches sanityn 56a/56b and adds a ZFS helper, so it is not the cause. Rate about 0.3% of review-ldiskfs-dne-arm runs. Same-run failures of 413h ("all objects created on MDT 0") and 413c suggest MDT selection in lmv/lod is being skewed in these runs (MDT0 reported with lower free blocks than the others, weight diff 124%), possibly a QOS/RR interaction after MDT space imbalance from earlier tests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-69798-ps5-8cf00c6b1b41 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/69798" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/69798&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
